%% DPPL: interaksi teknis berdasarkan skenario SKPL
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor WarehouseAdmin as Workshop Warehouse Administrator
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant Service as InventoryService
    participant Records as StockRepository
    participant Dep as AccessPolicy
    WarehouseAdmin->>UI: Record a stock receipt or correction
    UI->>Service: Submit workshop inventory management request
    Service->>Records: Load stock for the selected workshop
    Records-->>Service: Return current records and validation result
    Service->>Service: Validate status unit dan cakupan bengkel
    alt Valid
        Service->>Dep: requireWorkshopScope(staff, workshop)
        Dep-->>Service: Result
        Service->>Records: Update physical unit records and statuses
        Records-->>Service: Confirm the saved or calculated result
        Service-->>UI: Display available and pending units
        UI-->>WarehouseAdmin: Display the result and next step
    else Request needs correction or review
        Service-->>UI: Reject a correction outside the assigned workshop
        UI-->>WarehouseAdmin: Display the reason and required action
    end
